  "description": "Flat to Let – Langrishe Place, Dublin 1\n\nRent: €1,750 per month\n\nBright and well-presented flat available to rent in the heart of Dublin City Centre at Langrishe Place, Dublin 1 (suitable for maximum 2)\n\nThis self-contained studio offers comfortable city living with excellent access to public transport, local shops, cafes, restaurants, and all amenities the city centre has to offer.\n\nAccommodation Includes:\nOpen-plan living/sleeping area\nFully fitted kitchen\nPrivate bathroom\nFurnished\nWell-maintained property\nBills Included:\n\nBills Not Included:\nElectricity to be paid by tenant and bins.\n\nLocation:\n\nSituated in a highly convenient city-centre location, within walking distance of:\nO'Connell Street\nIFSC\nMater Hospital\nCroke Park\nLUAS and Dublin Bus services\n\nAdditional Information:\nReferences required\nDeposit and one month's rent payable in advance\nNon-smoking property\nAvailable immediately (if applicable)\nNo pets allowed",
